sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Controls as DiagramControls
    participant Core as MermaidRenderer
    participant Engine as DiagramRenderer
    participant Mermaid as Mermaid.js

    User->>Controls: Input diagram code
    Controls->>Core: Update diagram state
    Core->>Engine: Render request
    Engine->>Mermaid: Initialize with config
    Mermaid-->>Engine: Return SVG
    Engine-->>Core: Update DOM
    Core-->>Controls: Update UI state
    Controls-->>User: Show rendered diagram

    Note over Controls,Engine: Theme, font, and color<br/>settings flow similarly

    User->>Controls: Request SVG download
    Controls->>Engine: Get SVG element
    Engine-->>Controls: Return SVG data
    Controls->>User: Download SVG file
